{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04344","headline":"秋日题汝阳潭壁 · 刘希夷","name":"秋日题汝阳潭壁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"独坐秋阴生，悲来从所适。\n行见汝阳潭，飞萝蒙水石。\n悬瓢木叶上，风吹何历历。\n幽人不耐烦，振衣步闲寂。\n回流清见底，金沙覆银砾。\n错落非一文，空胧几千尺。\n鱼鳞可怜紫，鸭毛自然碧。\n吟咏秋水篇，渺然忘损益。\n秋水随形影，清浊混心迹。\n岁暮归去来，东山余宿昔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘希夷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04344.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04344","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}